{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c587","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c40c-7a6a-7610-adaa-109852fda585"},"sequence":286,"recorded_at":1780531400000567,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2"},"call_id":"call_01a0c40d5093763fbe72c1286cd364ac","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-35urbp/TASK-260830-35urbp_review-verdict-rev2.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-35urbp — review verdict, Change Request revision 2\n2|\n3|**Verdict: CHANGES REQUESTED** (routed `to-dev`). One P2 class, five P3. Every rev1 P1/P2/P3\n4|finding is closed with driven evidence; what remains is one entry-reachable one-sided pin on\n5|the verify custody path plus evidence-hygiene items. The rework is small and enumerated at the end.\n6|\n7|- Reviewer run: RUN-260921-5a9d4b (claude-opus-5 max), reviewing CR-TASK-260830-35urbp-2 rev 2\n8|  published by RUN-260921-6e7be5 (muse-spark max) after the rev1 rework brief.\n9|- Reviewed bytes: base `799c338e401fca0b24859c0b870cd665927209f2` (= `origin/main` at review\n10|  time, `git diff --name-only 799c338 origin/main` empty — no trunk drift), candidate tree\n11|  `19820613a48f6a3ea239e97d878d936804bf01a8`, patch sha256\n12|  `54f83ebec9f3f9ba8867c4cf53c8f131bbc0f54712440ef8c1c3a658a3548cca` (recomputed from the tree\n13|  pair with `git diff base tree | sha256`, equal). The live Story worktree's uncommitted tree was\n14|  recomputed through a temporary index and equals the CR tree. Every measurement below was taken\n15|  on three `git archive` copies of that tree (`candidate`, `mutant-copy`, `probe-copy`, each\n16|  re-hashed to `19820613` through a temporary index before and after use); the live worktree,\n17|  its index, branch and HEAD were not touched; no product edit, commit, checkpoint or\n18|  integration was performed. `git status` in the live worktree is unchanged\n19|  (`M LOGBOOK.md`, `M README.md`, `?? internal/tmuxserver/`).\n20|- Normative authority: pinned `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md` §4.2 (1403-1449), §4.3 (1458),\n21|  §4.4, with §4.C/§4.D/§4.E; the task record's v0.5.0 Scope is stale. The candidate cites the\n22|  pinned file only (grep: no `0.5.0` anywhere in the package; every quoted sentence is present\n23|  in the pinned file).\n24|- Note on the rev2 reviewer brief: its templated sentence \"revisions 1..1 carry no review\n25|  verdict\" is wrong for this task — rev1 was reviewed by RUN-260921-0245e5 and routed CHANGES\n26|  REQUESTED (`TASK-260830-35urbp_review-verdict-rev1.md`). Rev2 was reviewed on its own merits\n27|  AND against closure of every rev1 finding.\n28|\n29|## What was reproduced (all on tree 19820613; PATH without any tmux binary, TMUX/TMUX_TMPDIR unset, no tmux process on the host)\n30|\n31|| Check | Result | Log (evidence archive) |\n32|| --- | --- | --- |\n33|| Configured suite, 30 commands read from `spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands` | **30/30 green, every command rerun by this reviewer**: 1 gofmt (729 tracked .go files), 2 build, 3 vet, 26/27 linux+windows build (`static-gates.log`); 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v`: 45/45 ok, 0 FAIL, 14 pre-existing SKIP outside this package, 19 indented `--- FAIL` lines are mutant-kill excerpts inside the passing resumesmoke `TestSmokeMutantsAreKilled` (`cmd04-test-v.full.log`); 5 race: 45 ok, 0 DATA RACE, 7m02s (`cmd05-race.log`); 6 `go test ./... -cover -count=1`: 45/45 ok, tmuxserver 91.6% (`cmd06-cover.log`); 7-23 fuzz seeds all exit 0, 24 tracecheck exit 0 (70/574), 25 cataloggen -check exit 0, 28 JSON parse (141 files) exit 0 (`cmd07-25-28.log`); 29 `task-board validate` exit 0 with the board's pre-existing 180 issues (`cmd29-validate.log`); 30 `git diff --check`