Acquire` on both paths, not only through the helpers. (c)\n179|Landed owners composed (listed above) — only package-specific rules\n180|are new; the rev1 fork is deleted. (d) Inputs driven, effects asserted\n181|(spy call counts, argv bytes, socket equality, typed details, attach\n182|vs refuse on stale vs bound admissions); no census stands in for\n183|behavior. (e) 40 narrowing rows + labeled additive + applied SURVIVED\n184|control, one raw log per plant per run, narrowing-vs-additive stated\n185|per row. (f) Every \"never/composes\" sentence is backed by a\n186|failing-without test or stated as an explicit bound (B1-B14).","final_result":true}}}
