socket.go) | TestSocketPathDerivesOnlyFromRuntimeDir |\n22|| 17 | MUST NOT discover or reuse the default server by ambient socket name, under hostile ambient on all five members | `ResolveSocket` (socket.go) | TestResolveSocketDerivesIgnoringAmbient |\n23|| 18 | Ambient facts observed without use | `ObserveAmbient` (socket.go) | TestObserveAmbientRecordsWithoutUsing, TestObserveAmbientNilLookupKeepsOutOfBand |\n24|| 19 | Environment-variable vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/environment_variable |\n25|| 20 | Inherited-socket vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/inherited_socket |\n26|| 21 | Default-path vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/default_path |\n27|| 22 | Conventional-name vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/conventional_name |\n28|| 55 | TMUX_TMPDIR vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/tmux_tmpdir |\n29|| 23 | Ambient value colliding with the derived socket refuses on every member | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesAmbientCollision (5 subtests), TestResolveSocketRefusesAmbientCollision (5 subtests) |\n30|| 40 | Absent server spawns dedicated with exact -S argv disjoint from every ambient vector | `Acquire` via `BuildArgv` | TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer |\n31|| 41 | Running attested dedicated server attaches with no second spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundAttachesToRunningAttested |\n32|| 46 | Spawn vector carries the dedicated -S socket | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvAddressesOnlyTheDerivedSocket |\n33|| 47 | Ambient sockets refuse at the spawn vector on all five members | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvRefusesAmbientSocket (5 subtests) |\n34|\n35|## §4.2 credential-sensitive creation; background broker-or-refuse\n36|\n37|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n38||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n39|| 24 | A background CLI MAY contact an already-running authenticated Aqua broker and its attested AX tmux server (macOS) | `Acquire` via `CheckBrokerContact` | TestAcquireBackgroundContactsBroker |\n40|| 25 | If neither exists it MUST return `capability_unavailable` with typed realm/readiness details: no broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/no_broker |\n41|| 26 | Same: foreign-user broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/foreign-user_broker |\n42|| 27 | Same: unattested server | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/unattested_server |\n43|| 28 | Same: stale-generation admission | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/stale_server_admission, .../generation-unbound_principal |\n44|| 29 | Linux background miss likewise refuses without fallback | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissOnLinuxAlsoRefusesWithoutFallback |\n45|| 30 | Broker probe failure is unknown, never unavailable, with no spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundProbeFailurePassesThrough |\n46|| 31 | A Background caller MUST NOT create a credential-dependent tmux server; MUST NOT fall back to direct server creation | `checkCreationAllowed` via `Acquire` | TestCheckCreationAllowedRefusesBackground, TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable (N-creation-literal kill path) |\n47|| 42 | Running unattested server refuses with no spawn and no repair | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundRefusesRunningUnattested |\n48|| 43 | Server probe failure is unknown, never absent, with no spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundProbeFailurePassesThrough |\n49|| 44 | Spawn failure reports with exactly one attempt and no fallback | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundSpawnFailureReportsWithoutFallback |\n50|| 45 | Malformed session refuses before any spawn | `Acquire` via `BuildArgv` | TestAcquireForegroundRefusesMalformedSession |\n51|| 48 | Session identity follows the landed UUIDv7 wiring | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvRefusesMalformedSession |\n52|| 54 | Spawn-then-retry converges to the one server with exactly one spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundSpawnIsIdempotentAcrossRetry |\n53|\n54|## §4.2 managername hint only; cached observations never authorize\n55|\n56|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n57||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n58|| 32 | A cached sentinel or prior `managername` observation MUST NOT authorize resume (background: a stale admission replayed on a miss still returns the typed unavailable) | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/stale_server_admission |\n59|| 33 | Same (foreground: a stale admission fakes no running attested server) | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundRefusesWrongGenerationAdmission |\n60|| 34 | Bound admitted row admits | `CheckServerAttested` (readiness.go) | TestCheckServerAttestedAdmitsBound |\n61|| 35 | Missing realm row refuses, including a decoy capability | `CheckServerAttested` (readiness.go), `Acquire` | TestCheckServerAttestedRefusesEachMissingConjunct, TestAcquireForegroundRefusesRunningUnattested |\n62|| 36 | Wrong-generation admission refuses | `CheckServerAttested` (readiness.go), `Acquire` | TestCheckServerAttestedRefusesEachMissingConjunct, TestAcquireForegroundRefusesWrongGenerationAdmission, TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/stale_server_admission |\n63|| 37 | Foreign-user broker principal refuses (`§4.4` same-user) | `CheckBrokerContact` (readiness.go), `Acquire` | TestCheckBrokerContactRefusesEachMissingFact, TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/foreign-user_broker |\n64|| 38 | Generation-unbound broker principal refuses (`§4.4` generation-bound) | `CheckBrokerContact` (readiness.go), `Acquire` | TestCheckBrokerContactRefusesEachMissingFact, TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/generation-unbound_principal |\n65|| 39 | Complete broker report admits | `CheckBrokerContact` (readiness.go) | TestCheckBrokerContactAdmitsLiveReport |\n66|\n67|## §4.C wrapper entrypoint shape (cited)\n68|\n69|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n70||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n71|| 46 | Every managed pane MUST run `ax pane <logical-session-id>` (spawn tail) | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvAddressesOnlyTheDerivedSocket, TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer (tail assertion) |\n72|\n73|## §4.D capability binding (cited landed)\n74|\n75|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n76||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n77|| 25-28 | Typed refusal names `credential_capable_execution_realm` with the exact Section 15.3 detail set | `Acquire` via `axerror.NewRealmEvidenceUnavailable` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable (detail assertions in every subtest) |\n78|\n79|## §4.E owner-only sensitive runtime state\n80|\n81|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n82||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n83|| 1 | Runtime directory created owner-only (0700), explicitly under a restrictive umask | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirCreatesOwnerOnly, TestEnsureRuntimeDirEnforcesModeUnderRestrictiveUmask |\n84|| 2 | Re-ensure converges idempotently | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirIsIdempotent |\n85|| 3 | Compliant directory verifies | `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestVerifyRuntimeDirAdmitsCompliant |\n86|| 4 | Widened mode refuses, never silently repaired | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesWidenedMode |\n87|| 5 | Non-directory leaf refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf |\n88|| 6 | Symlink leaf refuses on commit and verify | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkLeaf, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkLeaf |\n89|| 7 | Foreign ownership refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesForeignOwnership |\n90|| 8 | Handle/path mismatch refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesHandleMismatch |\n91|| 9 | Symlinked root refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkRoot |\n92|| 10 | Malformed and missing roots refuse | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadRoots (4 subtests) |\n93|| 11 | Malformed names refuse | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadNames (6 subtests) |\n94|| 12 | Unknown platform refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadPlatform |\n95|| 13 | Verify refuses absence without creating | `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesAbsence, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesBadLexical, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesMissingRoot |\n96|| 14 | Linux and WSL2 share the unix custody discipline | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestLinuxAndWSL2ShareUnixCustody |\n97|| 15 | Windows platform refuses on every host; no tmux directory exists on Windows | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `Acquire` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesWindowsOnUnixHost, TestAcquireRefusesWindowsPlatform |\n98|| 52 | Foreground acquisition ensures the directory idempotently; background verifies without creating | `Acquire` via `EnsureRuntimeDir`/`VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestAcquireCreatesRuntimeDirIdempotently, TestAcquireBackgroundVerifiesWithoutCreating |\n99|| 53 | Crash between mkdir and fsync retries to the one verified directory (real SIGKILL) | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureCrashChildSelfTerminates |\n100|\n101|## §15.3 typed refusal shape (input validation)\n102|\n103|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n104||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n105|| 49 | Unknown caller refuses | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesUnknownCaller |\n106|| 50 | Missing typed-detail members refuse instead of emitting untyped | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesMissingRealmDetails (3 subtests) |\n107|| 51 | Missing dependencies refuse on every nil shape | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesMissingDependencies, TestAcquireBackgroundNilBrokerWithSpawnRefuses, TestAcquireForegroundNilSpawnWithProbeRefuses |\n108|\n109|## Mutant-to-gate map (all kills through the production entries above)\n110|\n111|N-mode-create (row 4, create arm), N-mode-verify (row 4, verify arm),\n112|N-fchmod-umask (row 1, explicit chmod arm),\n113|N-ownership-uid (row 7), N-containment-slash (row 11), N-containment-mismatch\n114|(row 8), N-containment-symlink (row 6, commit arm),\n115|N-containment-symlink-verify (row 6, verify arm), N-root-wiring (row 10),\n116|N-platform-wiring (row 12), N-platform-windows (row 15),\n117|N-override-env/inherited/default/conventional/tmpdir (rows 19-22, 55),\n118|N-collision + N-collision-inherited/tmuxenv/tmpdir/conventional (row 23),\n119|N-realm-membership (rows 35, 42), N-realm-generation (rows 33, 36),\n120|N-broker-uid (rows 26, 37), N-broker-generation (rows 28, 38),\n121|N-creation-literal (row 31), N-caller-vocabulary (row 49),\n122|N-details-remediation (row 50), N-unattested-foreground (rows 33, 36),\n123|N-acquire-commit-refusal (foreground custody wiring),\n124|N-acquire-verify-refusal (background custody wiring),\n125|N-spawn-swallow (row 44), N-probe-swallow-foreground/background (rows 43, 30),\n126|N-argv-socket + N-argv-tmuxenv (row 47), N-argv-shape (P3-D arm),\n127|N-argv-session (rows 45, 48), N-deps-background/foreground\n128|(row 51), D-background-fallback supplementary (rows 25-28), C-control SURVIVED.","final_result":true}}}
