 | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n38||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n39|| 24 | A background CLI MAY contact an already-running authenticated Aqua broker and its attested AX tmux server (macOS) | `Acquire` via `CheckBrokerContact` | TestAcquireBackgroundContactsBroker |\n40|| 25 | If neither exists it MUST return `capability_unavailable` with typed realm/readiness details: no broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/no_broker |\n41|| 26 | Same: foreign-user broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/foreign-user_broker |\n42|| 27 | Same: unattested server | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/unattested_server |\n43|| 28 | Same: stale-generation admission | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/stale_server_admission, .../generation-unbound_principal |\n44|| 29 | Linux background miss likewise refuses without fallback | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissOnLinuxAlsoRefusesWithoutFallback |\n45|| 30 | Broker probe failure is unknown, never unavailable, with no spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundProbeFailurePassesThrough |\n46|| 31 | A Background caller MUST NOT create a credential-dependent tmux server; MUST NOT fall back to direct server creation | `checkCreationAllowed` via `Acquire` | TestCheckCreationAllowedRefusesBackground, TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable (N-creation-literal kill path) |\n47|| 42 | Running unattested server refuses with no spawn and no repair | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundRefusesRunningUnattested |\n48|| 43 | Server probe failure is unknown, never absent, with no spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundProbeFailurePassesThrough |\n49|| 44 | Spawn failure reports with exactly one attempt and no fallback | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundSpawnFailureReportsWithoutFallback |\n50|| 45 | Malformed session refuses before any spawn | `Acquire` via `BuildArgv` | TestAcquireForegroundRefusesMal