Complete broker report admits | `CheckBrokerContact` (readiness.go) | TestCheckBrokerContactAdmitsLiveReport |\n66|\n67|## §4.C wrapper entrypoint shape (cited)\n68|\n69|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n70||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n71|| 46 | Every managed pane MUST run `ax pane <logical-session-id>` (spawn tail) | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvAddressesOnlyTheDerivedSocket, TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer (tail assertion) |\n72|\n73|## §4.D capability binding (cited landed)\n74|\n75|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n76||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n77|| 25-28 | Typed refusal names `credential_capable_execution_realm` with the exact Section 15.3 detail set | `Acquire` via `axerror.NewRealmEvidenceUnavailable` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable (detail assertions in every subtest) |\n78|\n79|## §4.E owner-only sensitive runtime state\n80|\n81|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n82||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n83|| 1 | Runtime directory created owner-only (0700), explicitly under a restrictive umask | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirCreatesOwnerOnly, TestEnsureRuntimeDirEnforcesModeUnderRestrictiveUmask |\n84|| 2 | Re-ensure converges idempotently | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirIsIdempotent |\n85|| 3 | Compliant directory verifies | `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestVerifyRuntimeDirAdmitsCompliant |\n86|| 4 | Widened mode refuses, never silently repaired | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesWidenedMode |\n87|| 5 | Non-directory leaf refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf |\n88|| 6 | Symlink leaf refuses on commit and verify | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkLeaf, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkLeaf |\n89|| 7 | Foreign ownership refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesForeignOwnership |\n90|| 8 | Handle/path mismatch refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesHandleMismatch |\n91|| 9 | Symlinked root refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesSymlinkRoot |\n92|| 10 | Malformed and missing roots refuse | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadRoots (4 subtests) |\n93|| 11 | Malformed names refuse | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadNames (6 subtests) |\n94|| 12 | Unknown platform refuses | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesBadPlatform |\n95|| 13 | Verify refuses absence without creating | `VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesAbsence, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesBadLexical, TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesMissingRoot |\n96|| 14 | Linux and WSL2 share the unix custody discipline | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestLinuxAndWSL2ShareUnixCustody |\n97|| 15 | Windows platform refuses on every host; no tmux directory exists on Windows | `EnsureRuntimeDir`, `Acquire` | TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesWindowsOnUnixHost, TestAcquireRefusesWindowsPlatform |\n98|| 52 | Foreground acquisition ensures the directory idempotently; background verifies without creating | `Acquire` via `EnsureRuntimeDir`/`VerifyRuntimeDir` | TestAcquireCreatesRuntimeDirIdempotently, TestAcquireBackgroundVerifiesWithoutCreating |\n99|| 53 | Crash between mkdir and fsync retries to the one verified directory (real SIGKILL) | `EnsureRuntimeDir` | TestEnsureCrashChildSelfTerminates |\n100|\n101|## §15.3 typed refusal shape (input validation)\n102|\n103|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n104||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n105|| 49 | Unknown caller refuses | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesUnknownCaller |\n106|| 50 | Missing typed-detail members refuse instead of emitting untyped | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesMissingRealmDetails (3 subtests) |\n107|| 51 | Missing dependencies refuse on every nil shape | `Acquire` | TestAcquireRefusesMissingDependencies, TestAcquireBackgroundNilBrokerWithSpawnRefuses, TestAcquireForegroundNilSpawnWithProbeRefuses |\n108|\n109|## Mutant-to-gate map (all kills through the production entries above)\n110|\n111|N-mode-create (row 4, create arm), N-mode-verify (row 4, verify arm),\n112|N-fchmod-umask (row 1, explicit chmod arm),\n113|N-ownership-uid (row 7), N-containment-slash (row 11), N-containment-mismatch\n114|(row 8), N-containment-symlink (row 6, commit arm),\n115|N-containment-symlink-verify (row 6, verify arm), N-root-wiring (row 10),\n116|N-platform-wiring (row 12), N-platform-windows (row 15),\n117|N-override-env/inherited/default/conventional/tmpdir (rows 19-22, 55),\n118|N-collision + N-collision-inherited/tmuxenv/tmpdir/conventional (row 23),\n119|N-realm-membership (rows 35, 42), N-realm-generation (rows 33, 36),\n120|N-broker-uid (rows 26, 37), N-broker-generation (rows 28, 38),\n121|N-creation-literal (row 31), N-caller-vocabulary (row 49),\n122|N-details-remediation (row 50), N-unattested-foreground (rows 33, 36),\n123|N-acquire-commit-refusal (foreground custody wiring),\n124|N-acquire-verify-refusal (background custody wiring),\n125|N-spawn-swallow (row 44), N-probe-swallow-foreground/background (rows 43, 30),\n126|N-argv-socket + N-argv-tmuxenv (row 47), N-argv-shape (P3-D arm),\n127|N-argv-session (rows 45, 48), N-deps-background/foreground\n128|(row 51), D-background-fallback supplementary (rows 25-28), C-control SURVIVED.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
