{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c703","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c40c-7a6a-7610-adaa-109852fda585"},"sequence":476,"recorded_at":1780531400000947,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2"},"call_id":"call_01a0c40d90c57557b7dc2c13c07ef61d","text":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/ownership_unix.go`.\n1|//go:build !windows\n2|\n3|package tmuxserver\n4|\n5|import (\n6|\t\"io/fs\"\n7|\t\"os\"\n8|\t\"syscall\"\n9|)\n10|\n11|// effectiveUID reports the process effective UID. It is a variable\n12|// only so seam-failure tests can force the foreign-ownership path\n13|// through the production entries: staging a foreign-owned directory\n14|// needs privilege no test may assume, and without the seam the\n15|// ownership refusal is untestable. Production code never reassigns\n16|// it.\n17|var effectiveUID = os.Geteuid\n18|\n19|// currentUID reports the process effective UID the broker same-user\n20|// arm decides over. It reads the effectiveUID seam so tests stage a\n21|// foreign broker without privilege; production code never reassigns\n22|// the seam.\n23|func currentUID() uint32 { return uint32(effectiveUID()) }\n24|\n25|// verifyOwnership enforces the ownership gate on unix: the directory\n26|// must belong to the effective UID. Mode bits are checked by the\n27|// caller against the exact 0700 requirement, so any group or world\n28|// access already refused there. A stat without ownership metadata\n29|// fails closed: unreadable ownership is never legitimate custody.\n30|func verifyOwnership(info fs.FileInfo) error {\n31|\tstat, ok := info.Sys().(*syscall.Stat_t)\n32|\tif !ok {\n33|\t\treturn &Error{Code: CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir, Detail: \"runtime ownership\"}\n34|\t}\n35|\tif stat.Uid != uint32(effectiveUID()) {\n36|\t\treturn &Error{Code: CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir, Detail: \"runtime ownership\"}\n37|\t}\n38|\treturn nil\n39|}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
