{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7c1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c40c-7a6a-7610-adaa-109852fda585"},"sequence":571,"recorded_at":1780531400001137,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c40d-b53d-7022-9176-4aa71edc1f64"},"task_id":"01a0c40d-b53d-7022-9176-4aa71edc1f64","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c40d-b53d-7022-9176-4aa71edc1f64","chunk":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/argv.go`.\n1|package tmuxserver\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/scalar\"\n5|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/secprim\"\n6|)\n7|\n8|// BuildArgv builds the dedicated server spawn vector: tmux addressed\n9|// by the exact -S socket with the stable pane entrypoint the spec\n10|// requires every managed pane to run (ax pane SESSION_ID). The\n11|// socket must be the one derived from the runtime directory: an\n12|// ambient socket passed here refuses instead of being addressed.\n13|// The session identity delegates to the landed UUIDv7 grammar, and\n14|// the assembled vector passes the landed argv shape gate before it\n15|// is returned, so a malformed vector never reaches the spawner.\n16|func BuildArgv(runtimeDir, socket, sessionID string) ([]string, error) {\n17|\tif socket != SocketPath(runtimeDir) {\n18|\t\treturn nil, &Error{Code: CodeAmbientReuse, Detail: \"spawn socket\"}\n19|\t}\n20|\tsession, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(sessionID)\n21|\tif err != nil {\n22|\t\treturn nil, &Error{Code: CodeInvalidArguments, Detail: \"session identity\"}\n23|\t}\n24|\targv := []string{\n25|\t\t\"tmux\",\n26|\t\t\"-S\", socket,\n27|\t\t\"new-session\",\n28|\t\t\"-d\",\n29|\t\t\"-s\", session.String(),\n30|\t\t\"ax\", \"pane\", session.String(),\n31|\t}\n32|\tif err := secprim.CheckArgv(argv); err != nil {\n33|\t\treturn nil, &Error{Code: CodeInvalidArguments, Detail: \"spawn argv\"}\n34|\t}\n35|\treturn argv, nil\n36|}","final_result":true}}}
