"VerifyRuntimeDir admitted a narrower-than-0700 directory\")\n+\t\t\t}\n+\t\t})\n+\t}\n+}\n+\n+func TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf(t *testing.T) {\n","final_result":true}}}
