{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d467","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c40c-7a6a-7610-adaa-109852fda585"},"sequence":2190,"recorded_at":1780531400004375,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"be2f90a4-329e-4dfe-906d-93614b40b7f2"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c424-5ae1-75a3-941a-03794d0eb382"},"task_id":"01a0c424-5ae1-75a3-941a-03794d0eb382","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c424-5ae1-75a3-941a-03794d0eb382","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-21\n-\n-### TASK-260830-35urbp rev2 — Private tmux server management rework (P1 attestation fork + Windows vet, 9 surviving narrowings)\n+## 2026-09-21\n+\n+### TASK-260830-35urbp rev3 — Private tmux server management rework (verify-side non-directory pin, both-empty arms, narrower-mode pin, cleaned collision)\n+\n+- REWORKED after review-verdict-rev2 (CHANGES REQUESTED: no P1, one P2, five P3; trunk unmoved at `799c338`, no refresh; every rev1 finding stays closed). P2-A: the verify-side non-directory refusal is now pinned on the entry the background path uses — `TestVerifyRuntimeDirRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf` (0700 regular file admitted outright under the mutant; FIFO under a 5s deadline so the no-hang property pins too) plus `TestAcquireBackgroundRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf` through the background entry, with harness row `N-containment-odirectory-verify` (kill signature: err-nil on both entries, 5s FIFO stall). Deliberate gate decision: the verify `Openat` carries no `O_NONBLOCK` — FIFO refusal relies on `O_DIRECTORY` failing fast, symmetric with the commit side, stated in TRACEABILITY row 5.\n+- P3-A: both-empty generation rows in both readiness tables plus `N-realm-empty-want` / `N-broker-empty-generation` (the broker row kills by reroute to the server-generation detail, disclosed in its note). P3-B: the narrower side of \"exactly 0700\" pinned — a pre-existing 0600/0500 leaf refuses `runtime mode` on both entries (`TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesNarrowerMode`, `N-mode-narrower-create/verify`), so the exact-0700 prose stands as written. P3-C: the collision gate compares `filepath.Clean` spellings (one production-line change; `/./` and `//` aliases refused at `ResolveSocket` and through `Acquire`, `N-collision-unclean` drops `Clean`; symlink aliases bound B16). P3-D: the rev1 LOGBOOK block folded into rev2 (F1-F3 preserved, stale bullets replaced with a SUPERSEDED pointer). P3-E: stat-failure arms stated as bound B15 (error-arm rows, never counted as narrowings). Observations: import-census no-fallback bound under B9, Perm-only mode bound B17 (hosttrust precedent), `sun_path` bound B18 owned by TASK-260830-1c28dz.\n+- Battery: 46 narrowing + 1 additive KILLED + control SURVIVED, 48/48 twice with identical verdicts and per-plant raw logs. AC: 55 of 55 rows driven through production entries by named tests (matrix rev3; row 5 names both entries, rows 4/23/36/38 name the new pins). Full 30-command suite green firsthand (race in 6 bounded groups, 45/45, no DATA RACE); `GOOS=windows go vet` exit 0; tmux-hidden suite 64 pass / 0 skip. Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\n+\n+### TASK-260830-35urbp rev2 — Private tmux server management rework (P1 attestation fork + Windows vet, 9 surviving narrowings)\n","final_result":true}}}
