ned by TASK-260830-1c28dz).\n\n**Measured evidence (all rerun firsthand, nothing accepted from rev2):** 55/55 AC rows driven; harness 48/48 (46 narrowing + additive + control) on two passes with identical verdicts and per-plant raw logs; full 30-command suite green including race 45/45 with no DATA RACE in 6 bounded groups; `GOOS=windows go vet` exit 0; tmux-hidden suite 64 pass / 0 skip; evidence tarball is a real gzip with a 121-entry verified MANIFEST (no self-entry, zero `__pycache__`). Candidate left UNCOMMITTED; `internal/traceability` untouched.\n\n**Deviations:** none from the rework brief. The `filepath.Clean` comparison cleans the candidate side against a Join-cleaned socket, which is exactly equivalent to cleaning both sides (`Clean` is idempotent).","reason":null}}
